/span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按品类设置——上衣以胸围肩宽为主，裤子以腰围臀围为主。推荐最高分的尺码，同时输出分数间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>top1</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>top2</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta S = S_{\\text{top1}} - S_{\\text{top2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为置信度代理：间隔大就直推，间隔小就展示两个码并附版型说明。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"FUNCTION recommend_size(u, size_chart, weights):&#10;    scores = {}&#10;    FOR size, ranges IN size_chart.dimensions_grouped_by_size:&#10;        s = 0&#10;        FOR dim, weight IN weights:&#10;            lo, hi = ranges[dim][size]&#10;            d = distance_to_interval(u[dim], lo, hi)&#10;            s += weight * exp(-(d^2) / (2 * sigma[dim]^2))&#10;        scores[size] = s&#10;&#10;    ranked = sort_desc(scores)&#10;    gap = ranked[0].score - ranked[1].score&#10;&#10;    IF gap &gt;= CONFIDENT_GAP:&#10;        RETURN { size: ranked[0].size, confidence: &quot;high&quot; }&#10;    ELSE:&#10;        RETURN { size: ranked[0].size, alternatives: [ranked[1].size],&#10;                 confidence: &quot;low&quot;, note: size_chart.easeNote }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FUNCTION recommend_size(u, size_chart, weights):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scores = {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FOR size, ranges IN size_chart.dimensions_grouped_by_size:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        s = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FOR dim, weight IN weights:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lo, hi = ranges[dim][size]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            d = distance_to_interval(u[dim], lo, hi)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            s += weight * exp(-(d^2) / (2 * sigma[dim]^2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scores[size] = s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ranked = sort_desc(scores)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    gap = ranked[0].score - ranked[1].score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IF gap >= CONFIDENT_GAP:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        RETURN { size: ranked[0].size, confidence: \"high\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ELSE:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        RETURN { size: ranked[0].size, alternatives: [ranked[1].size],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                 confidence: \"low\", note: size_chart.easeNote }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"冷启动与反馈闭环\">冷启动与反馈闭环</h3><p>新用户没有历史记录，模型只能靠自报数据。这时<strong>版型说明比尺码数字更有价值</strong>：与其说「推荐 M 码」，不如说「M 码胸围余量约 10cm；如果你想要宽松效果选 L」。这种表达把不确定性交给用户判断，同时教育了用户对版型的理解。</p>\n<p>闭环的关键是<strong>退货原因的结构化回写</strong>。退货原因填「太小」是一条可用信号（说明该用户在该款上应该上浮一档），填「不合适」则无信息量。所以退货流程里的原因选项设计直接决定了推荐系统能不能自我改进——这是一条跨越推荐与售后两个系统的数据契约，详见 <a href=\"../ar-conversion-ops/tryon-conversion-return-impact\">试穿对转化/退货的影响</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人台匹配与虚拟人台\">人台匹配与虚拟人台</h2><p>尺码推荐的进阶形态是<strong>人台匹配</strong>：不为用户选码，而是生成一个接近用户体型的虚拟人台，把商品穿在上面渲染。</p>\n<h3 id=\"参数化人体模型\">参数化人体模型</h3><p>这条路线的核心是参数化人体模型（如 SMPL 一系）：用少量形状参数控制体型变化，姿态参数控制姿势。它的好处是<strong>体型是连续的</strong>——可以做「肩膀宽一点、腰细一点」的插值，而不是在离散尺码间跳。用户用手机扫描或手动调参，得到一个体型向量，再据此推荐尺码或直接渲染。</p>\n<p>参数化模型的工程约束是它与商品资产的接口：商品的试穿版本必须能绑定到同一套骨骼拓扑上，否则「人台」和「衣服」对不上。这正是 <a href=\"apparel-shoe-fit-tryon\">服装与鞋的虚拟试穿</a> 里提到的蒙皮权重成本，也是 Khronos 3D Commerce 推动 Body Attachment Points 标准化的动机（<a href=\"https://www.khronos.org/3dcommerce/\">Khronos 3D Commerce</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"落地的三种形态\">落地的三种形态</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>用户输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>尺码推荐器</td>\n<td>身高体重 / 历史</td>\n<td>一个尺码 + 置信度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全品类，覆盖所有用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体型可视化</td>\n<td>少量参数</td>\n<td>静态人台渲染图</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>服装，帮助理解版型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟人台试穿</td>\n<td>手机扫描</td>\n<td>可交互的 3D 人台穿衣</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高客单价服装、定制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>它们不是替代关系而是递进关系：<strong>尺码推荐器是必须有的底座</strong>，其余两者是锦上添花。一个常见的资源错配是把预算全押在虚拟人台上，结果 90% 的用户从未上传过扫描数据，尺码推荐这块底座反而缺失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>尺码推荐是虚拟体验里投入产出比最高的一环：不渲染画面，直接作用于退货率；2025 年线上退货率 19.3%，服装鞋类因尺码难判断而高于平均。</li>\n<li>用户体型数据按可用性分三层（自报 / 历史 / 三维扫描），精度差异极大，正确做法是把精度并入置信度输出，而不是只取最高精度那一源。</li>\n<li>商品尺码表的脏数据是更普遍的问题；<code>measureBasis</code>（身体围度 vs 成衣平铺）必须作为必填字段在入库时校验，缺了它所有下游计算都建立在隐含假设上。</li>\n<li>匹配算法从朴素区间查表演进到软约束打分（高斯核 + 品类权重），并用 top1 与 top2 的分数间隔作为置信度代理，间隔小就给两个码加版型说明。</li>\n<li>人台匹配用参数化人体模型让体型连续化，但要求商品试穿资产绑定统一骨骼拓扑——这就是蒙皮权重成本与 Body Attachment Points 标准化工作的由来。</li>\n<li>落地形态是三段递进：尺码推荐器是必须的底座，体型可视化与虚拟人台试穿是增量；把预算全押在需要用户扫描的形态上是常见的资源错配。</li>\n<li>推荐系统靠退货原因的结构化回写形成闭环，这要求退货流程的原因选项可被算法消费，见 <a href=\"../ar-conversion-ops/tryon-conversion-return-impact\">试穿对转化/退货的影响</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"尺码推荐与人台匹配","id":"尺码推荐与人台匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"三个数据源的可靠性阶梯","id":"三个数据源的可靠性阶梯"},{"level":3,"text":"商品侧才是真正的脏数据源","id":"商品侧才是真正的脏数据源"},{"level":2,"text":"基于身体测量的匹配","id":"基于身体测量的匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"人体测量标准是共同语言","id":"人体测量标准是共同语言"},{"level":3,"text":"匹配算法：从区间查表到概率模型","id":"匹配算法-从区间查表到概率模型"},{"level":3,"text":"冷启动与反馈闭环","id":"冷启动与反馈闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"人台匹配与虚拟人台","id":"人台匹配与虚拟人台"},{"level":3,"text":"参数化人体模型","id":"参数化人体模型"},{"level":3,"text":"落地的三种形态","id":"落地的三种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服装与鞋的虚拟试穿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/ar-tryon-size/apparel-shoe-fit-tryon"},"next":{"title":"家具摆放与眼镜美妆 AR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/ar-tryon-size/furniture-placement-beauty"}}